What does this program print?

```csharp
static void Move(Counter c) => c.Value += 10;

Counter a = new() { Value = 1 };
Move(a);
Box b = new() { Value = 1 };
Shift(b);
Console.WriteLine($"{a.Value} {b.Value}");

static void Shift(Box box) => box.Value += 10;

struct Counter { public int Value { get; set; } }
class Box { public int Value { get; set; } }
```

